@minutes 120
@description
All functions of Coding Exam 1 in the original order. The tests at the bottom are the original main() of the paper.
@tasks c-leap-year c-reversed-palindrome c-prime c-binary-to-decimal c-right-triangle c-isosceles-triangle c-isosceles-triangle-2 c-find c-second-largest c-copy-array c-insert-element c-delete-element c-frequency-count c-count-duplicates c-reverse-array c-rotate-left c-two-movies c-print-array
